OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs optimism at heart
OL,4,Aof his vision for UK
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe second aspect is decentralising
OL,7,Fpower - in particular No 10 North, the
OL,8,Fnew government unit based in
OL,9,FManchester, which he will argue is
OL,10,Ffundamentally reshaping how the country
OL,11,Fis run.
OL,13,FHe will promise to "unlock a feeling of
OL,14,Fpositivity and possibility" in every
OL,15,Fpart of the country.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/40
