OL,3,ANepal death toll nears 1,000 as
OL,4,Arescuers race to find workers trapped
OL,5,Ain mud-filled tunnels
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe death toll in Nepal from
OL,8,Fdevastating floods on the border with
OL,9,FTibet has reached 987, according to the
OL,10,Fcountry's disaster agency.
OL,12,FSome 3,916 people remain missing - of
OL,13,Fwhom more than 600 are workers believed
OL,14,Fto be trapped in a vast network of
OL,15,Fmud-filled tunnels at hydropower sites
OL,16,Falong Trishuli River.
OL,18,FEngineers have been pumping air into
OL,19,Fthe tunnels - and while a team did
OL,20,Fmanage to gain entry to one of them, it
OL,21,Fwithdrew after finding no-one there.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
