OL,3,AZambia's president to be sworn in for
OL,4,Asecond term while opponent detained
OL,5,
OL,6,FZambia's President Hakainde Hichilema
OL,7,Fis due to be sworn in for a second
OL,8,Ffive-year term on Tuesday following a
OL,9,Fdisputed election and the arrest of his
OL,10,Fmain opponent on treason charges.
OL,12,FHichilema ` credited with stabilising
OL,13,Fthe economy ` swept to victory on 13
OL,14,FAugust with 60% of the vote, according
OL,15,Fto official results. Runner-up Brian
OL,16,FMundubile, who received 38%, alleged
OL,17,Fthat the outcome had been tampered
OL,18,Fwith.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/40
